**95.** In relation to a DATE “issued” and a DATE “transferred”, a transfer from means Transfer where date the securities were issued is issued, date of the transfer is transferred, to the issuer of the securities is FALSE, to an accredited investor is FALSE, as part of an offering registered with the Commission is FALSE, to a member of the family of the purchaser or the equivalent is FALSE, to a trust controlled by the purchaser is FALSE, to a trust created for the benefit of a member of the family of the purchaser or the equivalent is FALSE, in connection with death of the purchaser is FALSE, in connection with divorce of the purchaser is FALSE and in connection with a circumstance similar to death or divorce of the purchaser is FALSE.

